      "writtenOn": "2024-03-21T08:15:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If prefer to handle it by power state transition, I think setting s5_inactivity_timeout to 0 to enter G3 immediately should be fine. The sequencing is handled in board_ap_power_force_shutdown.",
      "parentUuid": "2d17a447_f3eecde5",
