      "writtenOn": "2024-03-22T18:29:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ridden, it seems the first option being proposed is to set s5_inactivity_timeout to zero. It\u0027s in power/common.c. If it doesn\u0027t violate Intel\u0027s spec, can you please try that and see if it works without affecting normal shutdown sequences?",
