      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T02:26:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In fact, according to my tests, set s5_inactivity_timeout to zero has no effect. \n```\n#ifdef CONFIG_CMD_S5_TIMEOUT\nstatic int s5_inactivity_timeout \u003d 0;\n#else\nstatic const int s5_inactivity_timeout \u003d 0;\n#endif\n```\nMaybe it\u0027s because uldren or nissa don\u0027t have CONFIG_EC_POWERSEQ\n\n```\nzephyr_library_sources_ifdef(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_POWERSEQ\n                                                 \"${PLATFORM_EC}/power/common.c\")\n```",
      "parentUuid": "9218346d_6a039e40",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1050,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1050,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "bd08eedad402193773cc410fa0898d16abaa0981",
